From 1dd90e01ccea6586da93b6b511ebab57b72ba26b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:18:32 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: add Hikari Timpani control and Q6v3 audio bring-up

Describe Sony bus and power wiring. Add native runtime-managed Timpani control and an explicitly started QDSP6v3 remoteproc, with fixed DDR/TCM split firmware loading and the Sony reset sequence. PCM, analog routing and microphone bias remain to be implemented and physically validated.

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
